\fs24 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 description: 
\f1\fs26 Earth proposes a ritual for saying goodbye in a society where shared forms around death have become less present. The ritual is built around earth as a material and as something that can be handled, carried and passed between people. Instead of prescribing a fixed way of mourning, the setting creates a situation for exchange: between those who are leaving and those who stay, between personal memories and something shared. The objects and actions become a framework for a farewell that can be shaped collectively.
